@startuml OctoTify_Sequence_RecordStatus

skinparam sequenceStyle svg
skinparam linetype ortho

title 更新推送状态（通用）

participant "MessageService" as Service
database "SQLite" as DB

note over Service: 推送完成后更新消息状态\n状态流转：\n100（待推送）→ 200（成功）\n100（待推送）→ 300（失败）\n300（失败）→ 100（待推送）重试场景

== 场景1：推送成功，更新为 200 ==

Service -> DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION
activate DB
Service -> DB: UPDATE messages SET status = 200, updated_at = ? WHERE id = ?
activate DB

alt 数据库更新失败
    DB --> Service: 更新失败
    deactivate DB
    Service -> DB: ROLLBACK
    deactivate DB
    Service -> Service: 记录状态更新失败日志\nlogger.Error("更新消息状态失败", error, message_id, status)
else 数据库更新成功
    DB --> Service: 成功 (rows affected)
    deactivate DB
    Service -> DB: COMMIT
    deactivate DB
    Service -> Service: 状态更新成功
end

== 场景2：推送失败，更新为 300 ==

Service -> DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION
activate DB
Service -> DB: UPDATE messages SET status = 300, updated_at = ? WHERE id = ?
activate DB

alt 数据库更新失败
    DB --> Service: 更新失败
    deactivate DB
    Service -> DB: ROLLBACK
    deactivate DB
    Service -> Service: 记录状态更新失败日志\nlogger.Error("更新消息状态失败", error, message_id, status)
else 数据库更新成功
    DB --> Service: 成功 (rows affected)
    deactivate DB
    Service -> DB: COMMIT
    deactivate DB
    Service -> Service: 状态更新成功
end

== 场景3：重试场景，300 → 100 ==

Service -> DB: BEGIN TRANSACTION
activate DB
Service -> DB: UPDATE messages SET status = 100, updated_at = ? WHERE id = ?
activate DB

alt 数据库更新失败
    DB --> Service: 更新失败
    deactivate DB
    Service -> DB: ROLLBACK
    deactivate DB
    Service -> Service: 记录状态更新失败日志\nlogger.Error("更新消息状态失败", error, message_id, status)
else 数据库更新成功
    DB --> Service: 成功 (rows affected)
    deactivate DB
    Service -> DB: COMMIT
    deactivate DB
    Service -> Service: 状态更新成功，准备重试推送
end

@enduml
